[/asy]

Quadrilateral $ABCD$ is a parallelogram.  What is the degree measure of angle $A$? [asy]
size(100);
draw((0,0)--(5,2)--(6,7)--(1,5)--cycle);
draw((5,2)--(7.5,3));
draw(Arc((5,2),1,20,80));
label("$D$",(0,0),SW); label("$C$",(5,2),SE); label("$B$",(6,7),NE); label("$A$",(1,5),NW);

